B.buA=new A.l6("\ud83c\udf93","PECS videos and webinars","Pyramid Educational Consultants","https://pecsusa.com/videos/","the people who publish PECS")
B.buz=new A.l6("\u25b6\ufe0f","PECSglobal channel","YouTube","https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5OIn7c4hRfVR9E2qBDoNCQ","official demonstrations of each phase")
B.buy=new A.l6("\ud83e\udde9","PECS Level 1 \u2014 what the training covers","Pyramid","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Dj6l4UJ0PCw","the six phases, explained in one sitting")
B.buw=new A.l6("\ud83d\udc67","A two-year-old using PECS at home","YouTube","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6M_PecoorLE","what a real exchange looks like")
B.bux=new A.l6("\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f","Real Look Autism \u2014 a communication device","Real Look Autism","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oIGrxzPMVtw","a family moving from pictures on")
B.buE=new A.l6("\ud83d\udcac","Getting started with AAC","The Speech Scoop","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YQClChMaLFM","modelling, and why adults go quiet")
