B.bez=s(["1. Keep communication within reach. Respond to pictures, words, gestures and other ways the person communicates.","2. Offer help only if it is wanted. Never move someone\u2019s hands or body without permission. Respect a no, a change of mind or a break.","3. Choose photographs, drawings or symbols together. Use what makes sense to the person; there is no single best picture for everyone.","4. Speak in a way and at a pace that works for them. Allow time to respond without requiring an answer.","5. Never take communication away as punishment or require it before meeting a basic need.","6. Notes and counts can help reflection, but do not diagnose a cause or measure wellbeing. Make any change with the person.","7. Notice sensory needs, comfort and pain. Seek appropriate support when needed, and make space for your own rest too."],t.s)
